('5717b771-06c1-45e6-8612-318241a1f8a0', 'The Ultimate Guide to GIA vs IGI Diamond Certification', 'gia-vs-igi-diamond-certification-guide', 'Floksy Master Gemologist', '2026-08-10 12:43:49.458', '/assets/floksy_diamonds_cat.png', 'Understanding key differences in diamond grading standards, cut proportions, and value retention.', '<h2>Demystifying Laboratory Diamond Certification</h2><p>When purchasing a diamond over 0.50 carats, independent laboratory certification ensures you receive exact gemological specifications.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, '2026-08-10 12:43:49.458', '2026-08-10 12:43:49.458'),
('c0685aa1-14e8-4e55-974e-1a37fbbb0017', 'Solitaire vs Halo Engagement Rings: Which Silhouette Suits You?', 'solitaire-vs-halo-engagement-ring-guide', 'Floksy Atelier Designer', '2026-08-10 12:43:49.458', '/assets/floksy_rings_cat.png', 'Comparing classic solitaire elegance with light-enhancing halo settings in 18K yellow gold and platinum.', '<h2>Choosing Your Perfect Engagement Ring Setting</h2><p>Solitaire settings accentuate pure diamond geometry, while halo designs amplify visual presence.</p>', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, '2026-08-10 12:43:49.458', '2026-08-10 12:43:49.458');
